<<<
dastard(ly). The essential & original meaning of the words is the same as that of coward(ly), so far at least that both pairs properly connote want of courage;
===
**dastard(ly).** The essential & original meaning of the words is the same as that of *coward(ly)*, so far at least that both pairs properly connote want of courage;
